msgid "Panel"
msgstr "面板"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服務"

msgid "Geo data"
msgstr "Geo 資料"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "執行中"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "未啟用"

msgid "Listener"
msgstr "監聽位址"

msgid "Open panel"
msgstr "開啟面板"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "啟動"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重啟"

msgid "API secret"
msgstr "API 金鑰"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "顯示"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隱藏"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "複製"

msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已複製"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "讀取中…"

msgid "Working…"
msgstr "處理中…"

msgid "Updating…"
msgstr "更新中…"

msgid "Update now"
msgstr "立即更新"

msgid "File"
msgstr "檔案"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Modified"
msgstr "修改時間"

msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安裝"

msgid "Never updated."
msgstr "尚未更新。"

msgid "The update completed."
msgstr "更新完成。"

msgid "The update failed."
msgstr "更新失敗。"

msgid "The operation completed."
msgstr "操作已完成。"

msgid "The operation failed."
msgstr "操作失敗。"

msgid "Could not read the dae service state."
msgstr "讀取 dae 服務狀態失敗。"

msgid "Could not read the geo data state."
msgstr "讀取 Geo 資料狀態失敗。"

msgid "If luci-app-dae was installed just now, restart rpcd so that its backend is registered."
msgstr "如果剛安裝 luci-app-dae，請重啟 rpcd 使其後端生效。"

msgid "dae"
msgstr "dae 引擎"

msgid "The doona panel drives the dae engine over its native HTTP API. dae serves the panel itself; this page shows the service state, opens the panel and updates the geo data."
msgstr "doona 面板透過 dae 的原生 HTTP API 驅動引擎。面板由 dae 自己託管；本頁顯示服務狀態、開啟面板，並更新 Geo 資料。"

msgid "The dae service is not enabled yet. Press Start to enable and start it."
msgstr "dae 服務尚未啟用，點「啟動」即可啟用並啟動。"

msgid "The dae service is stopped. Press Start to run it."
msgstr "dae 服務已停止，點「啟動」即可執行。"

msgid "The panel is not installed. Install the doona package."
msgstr "面板未安裝，請安裝 doona 套件。"

msgid "The panel is not reachable from this browser."
msgstr "目前的瀏覽器連不到面板。"

msgid "The API listens on the router itself, so the panel is not reachable from another machine."
msgstr "API 只監聽路由器本機，其他機器連不到面板。"

msgid "The panel asks for this secret the first time it is opened. It is also readable with: uci get dae.main.api_secret"
msgstr "面板首次開啟時會要求輸入這個金鑰。也可以用 uci get dae.main.api_secret 讀取。"

msgid "The secret is not available to this session."
msgstr "目前的工作階段無權讀取金鑰。"

msgid "The secret could not be written to the clipboard. It is shown instead."
msgstr "金鑰沒能寫入剪貼簿，已改為直接顯示。"

msgid "The dae service started."
msgstr "dae 服務已啟動。"

msgid "The dae service stopped."
msgstr "dae 服務已停止。"

msgid "The dae service restarted."
msgstr "dae 服務已重新啟動。"

msgid "The dae service did not start. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 服務啟動失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The dae service did not stop. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 服務停止失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The dae service did not restart. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 服務重新啟動失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The settings could not be written. Check the system log."
msgstr "設定寫入失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The operation is not known."
msgstr "未知操作。"

msgid "The dae service reported an issue."
msgstr "dae 服務回報了一個問題。"

msgid "The backend did not confirm the operation."
msgstr "後端沒有確認這次操作。"

msgid "The update was started."
msgstr "更新已開始。"

msgid "Another update is already running."
msgstr "已有更新正在進行。"

msgid "The update script is missing. Reinstall the dae package."
msgstr "更新腳本缺失，請重新安裝 dae 套件。"

msgid "The geo data was updated and dae was restarted."
msgstr "Geo 資料已更新，dae 已重新啟動。"

msgid "The geo data is already up to date."
msgstr "Geo 資料已是最新。"

msgid "The geo data was updated. It takes effect the next time dae starts."
msgstr "Geo 資料已更新，下次啟動 dae 時生效。"

msgid "The download or verification failed. The installed files were left untouched."
msgstr "下載或校驗失敗，已安裝的檔案未變動。"

msgid "The previous update was interrupted."
msgstr "上一次更新被中斷。"

msgid "dae did not come back up after the update; the previous files were restored."
msgstr "更新後 dae 未能啟動，已還原原有檔案。"

msgid "dae is not running and the previous files could not be restored. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 未執行且原有檔案無法還原，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The geoip.dat and geosite.dat files back the geoip: and geosite: rules. dae reads them when it starts, so it is restarted after an update."
msgstr "geoip.dat 與 geosite.dat 是 geoip: 與 geosite: 規則的資料來源。dae 只在啟動時讀取，因此更新後會重新啟動 dae。"

msgid "Panel writes"
msgstr "面板寫入"

msgid "Off — the panel can only read the configuration."
msgstr "關閉 — 面板只能讀取設定。"

msgid "On — the panel can change the configuration, nodes and groups."
msgstr "開啟 — 面板可以修改設定、節點與群組。"

msgid "Allow panel writes"
msgstr "允許面板寫入"

msgid "Stop panel writes"
msgstr "停止面板寫入"

msgid "Configuration, nodes, groups and rules can only be edited in the panel while writes are on."
msgstr "只有在寫入開啟時，才能在面板裡編輯設定、節點、群組與規則。"

msgid "The panel may now change the configuration."
msgstr "面板現在可以修改設定。"

msgid "The panel can only read the configuration now."
msgstr "面板現在只能讀取設定。"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "套用"

msgid "dae needs a numeric address and a port. Saving restarts the service immediately."
msgstr "dae 需要數值位址和連接埠；儲存後會立即重新啟動服務。"

msgid "Enter a listener address and port."
msgstr "請輸入監聽位址和連接埠。"

msgid "The listener was saved."
msgstr "監聽位址已儲存。"

msgid "The listener was not saved."
msgstr "監聽位址未儲存。"

msgid "The listener was saved and is in effect."
msgstr "監聽位址已儲存並生效。"

msgid "The listener was saved. It takes effect when the service starts."
msgstr "監聽位址已儲存，將在服務啟動時生效。"

msgid "The listener did not change."
msgstr "監聽位址沒有變更。"

msgid "The listener is invalid. Use a numeric address and a port, such as 0.0.0.0:9527."
msgstr "監聽位址無效。請填寫數值位址和連接埠，例如 0.0.0.0:9527。"

msgid "The new listener did not start; the previous address was restored."
msgstr "新監聽位址未能啟動，已還原原位址。"

msgid "The new listener did not start and the previous address could not be restored. Check the system log."
msgstr "新監聽位址未能啟動，且原位址還原失敗。請檢查系統日誌。"
